#
# Warren, services: layer 20 of the matrix. zxvd's engines are its
# services: each feature switch (features.get) with whether it is on and
# whether it is regulated, turned on or off by the owner (features.set; a
# restart is off then on, retried with back-off when the "on" fails), the
# energy each consumer drew and its share of the whole (power.top,
# power.status), the daemon itself (zxvd.version, sys.info) and its recent
# events (log.tail). Advisory and owner-confirmed: no switch changes
# outside the owner's session, and a regulated engine is never turned on
# without the owner's approval (warren_rules.h WR2, WR3).
#
# zxvd has no method that lists or controls host background processes
# outside it, no energy per engine (power.top ranks the system, apps and
# agents), no restart (off then on here), no method that says whose
# session this is (the view tells the model, as Gatehouse's grants) and no
# notification method (the model composes the notice). None is invented.
#
#   change_ok    may this switch change now (WR2). The task asks for Eve and
#                KRON; Eve checks each field against its own range only
#                (zxapp_eve.c EV2), and this rule relates fields ("a
#                regulated engine turned on needs approval": an or across
#                fields), so Sutra and KRON witness it, as Stillwater's
#                let_through and Threshold's rights_ok. A flag of 2 is no
#                flag to Sutra and a yes to KRON: held.
#   approval_ok  the owner's word for a regulated engine turned on (WR3), a
#                record Eve can declare: owner session 1 and approval 1,
#                Eve and KRON witnessed (the task's Eve + KRON pair); a flag
#                of 2 fits KRON's yes and not Eve's record: held.
#   backoff      the wait before each restart attempt (WR4): min(most,
#                base * 2^(k - 1)) for k = 1..tries, BASIC (as its twin
#                Hatchling) and KRON; BASIC refuses tries past 32, base
#                past 3600 or most past 86400 seconds, KRON answers: held.
#   banker.share each consumer's share of the energy drawn: the
#                share_of_whole concept is banker's (CONCEPTS.tsv), so it
#                is used, never written again. The task's "KRON + Trebago"
#                for it is not taken: banker runs it in KRON and C++
#                (WebAssembly), and its owner keeps its languages.
#   record_ok    an engine's service record, ^ZXWARREN, in MYRA (WR5).
#
# Planned languages: JCL owns jobs, and stands for the restart's retries
# (backoff). IPL owns list processing and symbolic search: no entry here
# is either, so it is not pending.
zxapp 1
id     warren
name   Warren
version 1.0.0
slot   20
layer  L1
matrix 20
icon   icons/l1/020-warren.svg
budget 233
needs  sys.read
needs  journal
needs  notify
model  apps/warren_model.c
use    banker 1   # @num.banker_share

# May this switch change now (WR2), Sutra and KRON.
provides change_ok truth owner regulated approved enable
logic    sutra change_ok apps/blocks/warren/change.sutra
logic    kron  change_ok apps/blocks/warren/change.kron

# The owner's approval for a regulated engine turned on (WR3), Eve and KRON.
provides approval_ok truth owner approved
logic    eve  approval_ok apps/blocks/warren/approval.eve
logic    kron approval_ok apps/blocks/warren/approval.kron

# A restart's back-off, one wait per attempt (WR4). BASIC, written in its
# twin Hatchling's canonical form (zxlang twin); the line names the runtime
# "basic", since the Alexandria index numbers runtimes, not twins.
provides backoff num tries base most
logic    basic backoff apps/blocks/warren/backoff.bas
logic    kron  backoff apps/blocks/warren/backoff.kron
pending  JCL backoff

# An engine's service record (WR5), in MYRA.
provides record_ok truth engine enabled regulated restarts changed
logic    myra record_ok apps/blocks/warren/service.myra

# Its own proof (zxapp.h K1): each entry at its edges, and where its languages disagree
check change_ok owner=1,1,1,1,1,0,0,1 regulated=0,0,1,1,1,0,1,1 approved=0,0,0,1,0,1,1,0 enable=1,0,1,1,0,1,1,0 = true,true,false,true,true,false,false,true
check change_ok owner=1,2 regulated=0,0 approved=0,0 enable=1,1 = both
check change_ok owner=1,1 regulated=1,1 approved=1,-1 enable=1,1 = both
check approval_ok owner=1,1,0,0 approved=1,0,1,0 = true,false,false,false
check approval_ok owner=1,1 approved=1,2 = both
check backoff tries=8 base=2 most=60 = 2,4,8,16,32,60,60,60
check backoff tries=1 base=3600 most=86400 = 3600
check backoff tries=8 base=0 most=60 = both
check backoff tries=4 base=2 most=86401 = both
check record_ok engine=0,99,100,1 enabled=1,9,1,10 regulated=0,9,0,1 restarts=0,999,0,1 changed=1700000000000,999999999999999,1,1 = true,true,false,false
check banker.share size=0,14090000,7045000 total=14090000 = 0,10000,5000
